    "body": "Well, it was bound to happen eventually.\r\n\r\nWe can probably set `MACOSX_DEPLOYMENT_TARGET` in our CI pipeline to explicitly target lower MacOS versions, but we'd need to figure out what the lowest version we're going to explicitly support is.\r\n\r\nAnother option might be to make a separate version for older MacOS deployment (x64-darwin).\r\n\r\nhttps://stackoverflow.com/questions/25352389/what-is-the-difference-between-macosx-deployment-target-and-mmacosx-version-min",
